          "message": "making the amalgamation script more robust (#657)\n\n* making the amalgamation script more robust\r\n\r\n* run git in the correct directory\r\n\r\nthis fixes a problem of building outside the git repository,\r\nwhich my IDE does by default.\r\n\r\nlike this:\r\ncd /somewhere/else\r\ncmake -B /tmp/outside -S /path/to/simdutf/\r\n\r\n* prevent amalgamation from picking up timestamp from parent git repo\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Paul Dreik <github@pauldreik.se>",
